{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> A Finnish solo project by Magnus R.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">BHOP and BLADEJUMP during combat to overwhelm your enemies with speed.  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/STEAM_GIF_COMBAT2.gif?t=1745406116\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">AIRSTRAFING and ROCKETJUMPING skills from other games will make you feel at home. Or if you're new, this will be your gateway to learning these skills.  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/STEAM_GIF_JUMP.gif?t=1745406116\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover strange experiments and forbidden technologies deep in the BAIONLENJA research facility.\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/STEAM_GIF_BOSS.gif?t=1745406116\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are SPIRIT, a fisherman with a mysterious origin who is stranded at an offshore research facility. The entity known as GEHIRN is calling you to venture deeper into the depths of the ominous megastructure, where your true purpose lies within.     <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/STEAM_PLAYERCHARACTER.png?t=1745406116\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3509160?t=1745406116","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3509160?t=1745406116","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/6a747aac7aa4648179f89838e61a9972d3a576ac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745406116","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/6a747aac7aa4648179f89838e61a9972d3a576ac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745406116","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> A Finnish solo project by Magnus R.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">BHOP and BLADEJUMP during combat to overwhelm your enemies with speed.  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/STEAM_GIF_COMBAT2.gif?t=1745406116\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">AIRSTRAFING and ROCKETJUMPING skills from other games will make you feel at home. Or if you're new, this will be your gateway to learning these skills.  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/STEAM_GIF_JUMP.gif?t=1745406116\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover strange experiments and forbidden technologies deep in the BAIONLENJA research facility.\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/STEAM_GIF_BOSS.gif?t=1745406116\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are SPIRIT, a fisherman with a mysterious origin who is stranded at an offshore research facility. The entity known as GEHIRN is calling you to venture deeper into the depths of the ominous megastructure, where your true purpose lies within.     <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/extras/STEAM_PLAYERCHARACTER.png?t=1745406116\" /></p></li></ul>","developers":["Magnus R"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509160/1c94e8faf4744a31adc564845cb01f93ac4ce5b1/header.jpg?t=1745406116","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257125580,"mp4